   "text": "Edith Cowan College Australia - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nEdith Cowan College Australia\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nEdith Cowan College (ECC) is an Australian tertiary education and English language provider and is accredited by the government under the Higher Education Act 2004 to provide a range of higher education courses.\nECC specialises in providing alternative pathways to ECU for students who may not qualify for direct entry into a degree program and are looking for a supportive learning environment. \nAs a highly experienced educational institution, ECC is dedicated to empowering students to achieve their academic and career goals. Located in the vibrant city of Perth, Western Australia, ECC offers a supportive and inclusive learning environment that nurtures students to excel in their chosen fields and be successful in their studies at ECU.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 05:52\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:19\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$35,000.00\nMin: A$13,600.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n6%\n1,250 of 21,615 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1991\nCampus(es)\nPerth\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NAsrXw6ShoE\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-\nFinished working",
